fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"svtav1/index.html#svtav1enc:maximum-buffer-size","fragment":"\n\tmaximum-buffer-size\n\nMaximum buffer size in milliseconds. Only used in CBR mode.\n\n\tFlags :\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRead\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWrite\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\tDefault value :\t1000\n\n"});